<section aria-labelledby="b2b-roles">
  <h2 id="b2b-roles">Who can do what</h2>
  <p>There are three roles: manager, front desk, and scorekeeper. That split is my call more than the research's. The interviews showed a front desk and a manager, and only one rink mentioned a scorekeeper. Everyone gets their own login and PIN, so every check-in and every score change records who did it. A scorekeeper only needs the game in front of them, and a manager can do everything.</p>
  <p>I listed 84 things staff do and set who can do each one. I decided every front desk action myself. For the rest, I reviewed and accepted Claude's suggestions.</p>
