<section aria-labelledby="b2b-now">
  <h2 id="b2b-now">Where I am now</h2>
  <p><strong>Done:</strong> the problem definition, an as-is journey map of a rink's week, 85 user stories ranked by priority, 15 success criteria, 14 concepts scored, 40 Crazy 8s sketches, 47 lo-fi screens linked into a clickable prototype, and who can do what across 84 actions.</p>
  <p><strong>Not done yet:</strong> nobody outside me has seen or tested the wireframes. The second round of interviews hasn't happened either, so everything so far rests on three interviews, all at two-sheet rinks.</p>
